            "review_title": "Review at Xanh Cafe",
            "review_text": "scrapmum\nSingapore, Singapore104 contributions\n0\nChance upon this...\nJun 2017\nGood place to be in the midst of the hustle and bustle of city, non air-con though. And I have to agree that the coffees were good, we had egg coffee and coconut coffee. It was a good pit-stop for us after a lunch and returning from Cuchi Tunnel tour. We then walked to The Independence Palace from this cafe.\nWritten September 22, 2017",
