            "review_title": "Review at Xanh Cafe",
            "review_text": "KGBtoo\nIsle of Wight, United Kingdom10 contributions\n0\nA little Gem\nApr 2017 • Solo\nSo good I went back the next day.\nSmoothies, raspberry for only 35,000. Plate of chicken rice, not much more. Served quickly by the charming chaps who run the place. Good quality and you eat almost at the roadside but out of the sun. Drop in, eat, drink and move on without wasting a moment - very enjoyable. Linger if you like.\nJust round the corner from the War museum and has fast free wi-fi. Mostly locals within.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 1, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
