            "review_text": "Tom V\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam122 contributions\n0\nVietnamese Coffee Shop good lication\nJul 2016 • Couples\nIn the corner of Truong Dinh and Nguyen Thi Minh Khai this no air conditioner place serves a wide rang of drinks and VN street style cafe. Prices are good. \n\nDecor is wood. The furniture is Vietnamese size so Dutch people may find it uncomfortable. \n\nThe best thing is the staff who are young friendly and work well to make your stay pleasant. Good place to stop for a quick refreshment on a hot day.\nRead more\nWritten July 25, 2016",
